# ============================================================
# test_ci .gitignore
# 忽略本地/CI 编译产物，保留工程文件与源码
# ============================================================

# --- Host 测试 (test/ CMake + Makefile + build.sh/bat) ---
test/build/
test/coverage/
**/coverage_report/
**/coverage/

# CMake
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
CMakeScripts/
cmake_install.cmake
install_manifest.txt
compile_commands.json
CTestTestfile.cmake
Testing/
_deps/
cmake-build-*/

# gcov / gcovr
*.gcda
*.gcno
*.gcov
*.gcov.json
*.info

# 编译/链接中间文件与可执行文件
